2    Assumptions and Notations
Assumption1: Insurance companies bear the risk independently
              信




Justification: In reality, insurance companies often diversify risks through financial products, govern-
ment support, and other means. Since we focus on the design of insurance products, we assume that
      微




insurance companies do not adopt risk diversification measures.




