Optimization for Sustainability
Ultimately, we propose DEMI to assess insurance companies’ sustainability. It is a dual-objective




                                                               学
optimization model, wherein we introduce a weight parameter λ to balance the importance of overall
risk and total demand.
    With an appropriate choice of λ, the model can effectively address both aspects. The specific




                                                        数
definition of the model is as follows:
                                 max Sustainability = λD − (1 − λ)R                                            (14)

